"Distinct from the in-process event bus (`src/switch_event.c`). [Ch "
"46](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/programming/esl-inbound)."
msgstr ""
"`mod_event_socket` 监听；客户端先 `auth`，再 `api` / `bgapi` / `event` / "
"`sendmsg`。vanilla 监听 `::`:8021；`fs_cli` 连到 "
"`127.0.0.1:8021`。不同于进程内事件总线（`src/switch_event.c`）。[第 46 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/programming/esl-inbound)。"

